{
  "group": "detailed briefs A — locations, balconies, washrooms",
  "note": "Prompts a client actually gives once they have thought about it: which room faces where, which balcony hangs off what, which toilet is attached and which is common. Ground truth uses `adjacent` so 'a balcony off the master bedroom' is checkable rather than merely stated.",
